{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "bookId": "math-graph_theory",
  "bookSlug": "graph_theory",
  "colSlug": "math",
  "chapterSlug": "10.4_第10章习题",
  "title": "第10章 习题",
  "html": "<div class=\"astrolib-chapter-content\"><h2 id=\"第10章-习题\"><span>第10章 习题</span><a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#第10章-习题\" aria-label=\"标题直链\"><svg class=\"anchor-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<div class=\"exercise-card toc-chunk\" data-title=\"练习 1\" id=\"练习-1\"><div class=\"card-header\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"4\"><span class=\"card-title-text\">练习 1</span></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>一个定向的完全图称为竞赛图 (tournament)。证明：每个竞赛图都包含一条 (有向的) Hamilton 路。</p>\n<p><details class=\"solution-details\" data-title=\"提示\" id=\"提示\"><summary>提示</summary><div class=\"solution-content\"><p>使用归纳法。</p>\n</div></details></p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"exercise-card toc-chunk\" data-title=\"练习 2\" id=\"练习-2\"><div class=\"card-header\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"4\"><span class=\"card-title-text\">练习 2</span></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>证明：任意一个可唯一 3-边着色的立方图是 Hamilton 的。(“唯一”是指所有的 3-边着色都导出同样的边划分。)</p>\n<p><details class=\"solution-details\" data-title=\"提示\" id=\"提示\"><summary>提示</summary><div class=\"solution-content\"><p>考虑两个着色类的并。</p>\n</div></details></p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"exercise-card toc-chunk\" data-title=\"练习 3\" id=\"练习-3\"><div class=\"card-header\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"4\"><span class=\"card-title-text\">练习 3</span></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>给定正偶数 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"k\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，对任意 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"n%20%5Cgeqslant%20k\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7733em;vertical-align:-0.1367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">⩾</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，构造一个阶为 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"2n%2B1\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"k\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>-正则图。</p>\n<p><details class=\"solution-details\" data-title=\"提示\" id=\"提示\"><summary>提示</summary><div class=\"solution-content\"><p>对于固定的 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"n\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，对 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"k\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 用归纳法，在归纳步骤中考虑 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"%5Coverline%7BG%7D\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n</div></details></p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"exercise-card toc-chunk\" data-title=\"练习 4\" id=\"练习-4\"><div class=\"card-header\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"4\"><span class=\"card-title-text\">练习 4</span></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>证明或反证如下命题 10.1.2 的加强结果：若 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"k\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>-连通图 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 满足 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"%7CG%7C%20%5Cgeqslant%203\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">⩾</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"%5Cchi(G)%20%5Cgeqslant%20%7CG%7C%2Fk\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">⩾</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\">∣/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 包含一个 Hamilton 圈。</p>\n<p><details class=\"solution-details\" data-title=\"提示\" id=\"提示\"><summary>提示</summary><div class=\"solution-content\"><p>什么样的 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"k\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>-连通图 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 满足 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"%5Cchi(G)%20%5Cgeqslant%20%7CG%7C%2Fk\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">⩾</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\">∣/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 但是不满足 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"%5Calpha(G)%20%5Cleqslant%20k\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">⩽</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>？</p>\n</div></details></p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"exercise-card toc-chunk\" data-title=\"练习 5\" id=\"练习-5\"><div class=\"card-header\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"4\"><span class=\"card-title-text\">练习 5</span></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>设 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 是一个图，<span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"H%20%3A%3D%20L(G)\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是它的线图。</p>\n<p>(i) 证明：如果 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 有一个支撑 Euler 子图，则 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"H\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 是 Hamilton 的。</p>\n<p>(ii)⁺ 如果 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 是 4-边连通的，证明 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"H\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 是 Hamilton 的。</p>\n<p><details class=\"solution-details\" data-title=\"提示\" id=\"提示\"><summary>提示</summary><div class=\"solution-content\"><p>对 (i)，首先考虑 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 本身有 Euler 环游的情形。对 (ii)，使用定理 1.8.1 和推论 2.4.2。</p>\n</div></details></p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"exercise-card toc-chunk\" data-title=\"练习 6\" id=\"练习-6\"><div class=\"card-header\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"4\"><span class=\"card-title-text\">练习 6</span></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>(i)⁻ 证明：Hamilton 图都是 1-坚韧的。</p>\n<p>(ii) 构造一个 1-坚韧但不包含 Hamilton 圈的图。</p>\n<p><details class=\"solution-details\" data-title=\"提示\" id=\"提示\"><summary>提示</summary><div class=\"solution-content\"><p>注意到，划分一个与奇数度顶点相关联的边是生成非 Hamilton 图的一个有用技巧。为了找到关于 (ii) 的例子，对一个高连通的小图运用这个技巧。</p>\n</div></details></p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"exercise-card toc-chunk\" data-title=\"练习 7\" id=\"练习-7\"><div class=\"card-header\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"4\"><span class=\"card-title-text\">练习 7</span></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>证明坚韧性猜想对可平面图成立。对于 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"t%20%3D%202\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>，或者 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"t%20%3C%202\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>，猜想成立吗？</p>\n<p><details class=\"solution-details\" data-title=\"提示\" id=\"提示\"><summary>提示</summary><div class=\"solution-content\"><p>一个可平面图的连通度可以有多大呢？</p>\n</div></details></p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"exercise-card toc-chunk\" data-title=\"练习 8\" id=\"练习-8\"><div class=\"card-header\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"4\"><span class=\"card-title-text\">练习 8</span></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>构造一个 Hamilton 图，使得它的度序列不是 Hamilton 的。</p>\n<p><details class=\"solution-details\" data-title=\"提示\" id=\"提示\"><summary>提示</summary><div class=\"solution-content\"><p>回想一下 Hamilton 序列的定义。</p>\n</div></details></p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"exercise-card toc-chunk\" data-title=\"练习 9\" id=\"练习-9\"><div class=\"card-header\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"4\"><span class=\"card-title-text\">练习 9</span></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>设 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 是一个图，它满足对任意的 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"i%20%3C%20%7CG%7C%2F2\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6986em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\">∣/2</span></span></span></span></span>，度数至多为 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"i\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的顶点少于 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"i\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个。运用 Chvátal 定理证明图 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 是 Hamilton 的。(因此，Chvátal 定理蕴含着 Dirac 定理)。</p>\n<p><details class=\"solution-details\" data-title=\"提示\" id=\"提示\"><summary>提示</summary><div class=\"solution-content\"><p>Chvátal 条件在什么样的顶点上发生呢？为了验证 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 满足条件，首先找到一个这样的顶点。</p>\n</div></details></p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"exercise-card toc-chunk\" data-title=\"练习 10\" id=\"练习-10\"><div class=\"card-header\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"4\"><span class=\"card-title-text\">练习 10</span></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>证明：<span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"k\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>-连通图 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 的平方图 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G%5E2\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"k\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>-坚韧的。运用这个结论证明 Fleischner 定理对于那些在 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"t%3D2\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 时满足坚韧性猜想的图成立。</p>\n<p><details class=\"solution-details\" data-title=\"提示\" id=\"提示\"><summary>提示</summary><div class=\"solution-content\"><p>考虑 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G%5E2\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 中的 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"k\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 分离，它的顶点把那些 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>-边连到哪里了？</p>\n</div></details></p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"exercise-card toc-chunk\" data-title=\"练习 11\" id=\"练习-11\"><div class=\"card-header\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"4\"><span class=\"card-title-text\">练习 11</span></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>证明练习 6 (i) 有如下弱逆命题：对任意非 Hamilton 图 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>，都存在图 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G'\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 使得 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G'\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的度序列点态大于 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 的度序列，但 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G'\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 仍然是 1-坚韧的。</p>\n<p><details class=\"solution-details\" data-title=\"提示\" id=\"提示\"><summary>提示</summary><div class=\"solution-content\"><p>使用定理 10.2.1。</p>\n</div></details></p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"exercise-card toc-chunk\" data-title=\"练习 12\" id=\"练习-12\"><div class=\"card-header\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"4\"><span class=\"card-title-text\">练习 12</span></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>(i)⁻ 证明：和满足 Dirac 条件 (即 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"%5Cdelta%20%5Cgeqslant%20n%2F2\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8311em;vertical-align:-0.1367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">⩾</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span>) 的图不一样，满足定理 10.1.3 中度条件的图可以是稀疏的：存在常数 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"d\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 使得，我们可以找到平均度最多为 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"d\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 的任意大的图并且满足定理 10.1.3 的条件。</p>\n<p>(ii) 证明：不存在整数 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"d\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 使得它是满足 Chvátal 条件的任意大图的平均度的上界。</p>\n<p><details class=\"solution-details\" data-title=\"提示\" id=\"提示\"><summary>提示</summary><div class=\"solution-content\"><p>度条件指出，对每一个导出路 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"uvw\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">uv</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"u\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"w\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 的公共邻点的个数至少和 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"v\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 的不与 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"u\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 或者 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"w\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 关联的邻点个数一样多。你是否可以构造一个“长”图使得它对所有这样的 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"uvw\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">uv</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 满足这个条件？也许这个图还具有有界的最大度？</p>\n</div></details></p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"exercise-card toc-chunk\" data-title=\"练习 13\" id=\"练习-13\"><div class=\"card-header\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"4\"><span class=\"card-title-text\">练习 13</span></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>找到一个连通图 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>，它的平方图 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G%5E2\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不包含 Hamilton 圈。</p>\n<p><details class=\"solution-details\" data-title=\"提示\" id=\"提示\"><summary>提示</summary><div class=\"solution-content\"><p>根据 Fleischner 定理，某些图的平方图中包含 Hamilton 圈，那么这些图和任意的连通图有什么不同？这种不同会如何妨碍 Hamilton 圈的存在呢？</p>\n</div></details></p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"exercise-card toc-chunk\" data-title=\"练习 14⁺\" id=\"练习-14\"><div class=\"card-header\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"4\"><span class=\"card-title-text\">练习 14⁺</span></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>对 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"%7CG%7C\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 使用归纳法证明：任意连通图 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 的 3 次方图 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G%5E3\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 包含 Hamilton 圈。</p>\n<p><details class=\"solution-details\" data-title=\"提示\" id=\"提示\"><summary>提示</summary><div class=\"solution-content\"><p>为了使用归纳法，考虑一个更强的命题。</p>\n</div></details></p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"exercise-card toc-chunk\" data-title=\"练习 15⁻\" id=\"练习-15\"><div class=\"card-header\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"4\"><span class=\"card-title-text\">练习 15⁻</span></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>利用 Fleischner 定理的证明方法来推导，2-连通图的平方图中任意两顶点之间都有一条 Hamilton 路。</p>\n<p><details class=\"solution-details\" data-title=\"提示\" id=\"提示\"><summary>提示</summary><div class=\"solution-content\"><p>把一个新的顶点连接到两个给定的顶点上。</p>\n</div></details></p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"exercise-card toc-chunk\" data-title=\"练习 16⁺\" id=\"练习-16\"><div class=\"card-header\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"4\"><span class=\"card-title-text\">练习 16⁺</span></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>设 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 是一个每个顶点的度均为奇数的图。证明：<span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 的每条边都属于偶数个 Hamilton 圈。</p>\n<p>(提示：设 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"xy%20%5Cin%20E(G)\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是任意给定的边，经过 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"xy\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 的 Hamilton 圈对应于 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G%20-%20xy\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 中从 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"x\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"y\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 的 Hamilton 路。考虑 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"G%20-%20xy\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 中从 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"x\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 出发的所有 Hamilton 路组成的集合 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"%5Cmathcal%7BP%7D\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0822em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，证明有偶数条 Hamilton 路的端点为 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"y\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>。定义一个 <span class=\"katex-inline-container\" data-latex=\"%5Cmathcal%7BP%7D\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" 